---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Kyle Murray | Technical Web Production and Content Operations" description="Kyle Murray's portfolio: enterprise CMS publishing, technical SEO, content operations, and practical AI discoverability experiments. Explore professional work and implementation evidence.">
  <main class="home">
    <section class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Kyle Murray · Raleigh, NC</p>
      <h1>Technical web production. From content to launch.</h1>
      <p class="lede">I bring content, design, and engineering together to publish reliable web experiences. My work spans enterprise CMS operations, technical SEO, and hands-on experiments in AI discoverability.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/projects/">Explore my work →</a>
        <a href="/resume/Kyle_Murray_Resume.pdf" download>Download résumé (PDF)</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/thekylemurray">LinkedIn</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="selected-work">
      <h2 id="selected-work">Selected work</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <a class="card" href="/case-studies/collibra-product-innovations/">
          <p class="eyebrow">Professional work · Collibra</p>
          <h2>Product innovations, from CMS to launch</h2>
          <p>Sanity authoring, Figma alignment, metadata, internal links, and launch coordination for new and upcoming product updates.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/web-ops/#applied-example">
          <p class="eyebrow">Applied QA example</p>
          <h2>From defect to verification</h2>
          <p>Follow an optional-form attribution issue through diagnosis, a code fix, and regression checks.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/ev-lab/">
          <p class="eyebrow">Working prototype</p>
          <h2>Structured content with Sanity and Astro</h2>
          <p>CMS-driven vehicle pages, reusable comparison content, and campaign attribution. Explore the implementation and its limits.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/experiments/javascript-rendered-content/">
          <p class="eyebrow">Rendering experiment</p>
          <h2>What is available before JavaScript runs?</h2>
          <p>Shared test content and initial-HTML checks across rendering examples, with AI retrieval evaluation still to come.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="next-steps" aria-labelledby="connect">
      <h2 id="connect">Experience behind the work</h2>
      <p>Enterprise SaaS at Collibra. Healthcare publishing at BayCare. Content strategy at Aware Senior Care.</p>
      <p><a href="/about/">More about me</a> · <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a> · <a href="/ai-search-lab/">Explore AI Search Lab</a> · <a href="/vehicles/">View the EV demo</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .next-steps { margin-top: 64px; }
</style>
